        "noSubjects": "No NPCs yet.",
        "gmNotes": "<p><strong>Example: Influence.</strong> Built for four level-3 PCs. Captain Brenn is level 3, so her base DC is 18.</p><p>The bridge toll is doubled this week and the party's caravan is stuck in the queue. The scene lasts four rounds of about ten minutes; each PC can Discover or Influence once a round.</p><p><strong>Each roll:</strong> an Influence success earns 1 Influence Point and a critical success 2. A critical failure loses 1. Use + and − on her counter. A Discover success reveals one hidden check or modifier; reveal it with its eye.</p><p><strong>Suspicion</strong> rises by 1 whenever a Deception check fails. At 3 she orders the caravan searched, and the scene ends.</p><p><strong>At the end:</strong> the highest reached threshold is the outcome.</p>",
        "rounds": {
          "current": 0,
          "max": 4
        },
        "multipleSubjects": true,
        "counters": [
          {
            "id": "c001",
            "name": "Suspicion",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 3,
            "display": "steps",
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "id": "t001",
                "points": 3,
                "name": "She orders the caravan searched",
                "reveal": "hidden",
                "description": "<p>The scene ends. The search takes the rest of the day.</p>"
              }
            ],
            "revealed": false
          }
        ],
        "modifiers": [],
        "subjects": [
          {
            "id": "s001",
            "name": "Captain Orsola Brenn",
            "description": "<p>The captain of the bridge guard, grey at the temples, with a ledger under one arm.</p><div data-visibility=\"gm\"><p>She doubled the toll on the town council's orders, to pay for repairs the council never made. She resents it.</p></div>",
            "revealed": true,
            "counters": [
              {
                "id": "c002",
                "name": "Influence Points",
                "thresholds": [
                  {
                    "id": "t002",
                    "points": 2,
                    "name": "She lets the caravan wait off the road",
                    "reveal": "points"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "t003",
