                    "name": "She charges the old toll",
                    "reveal": "points",
                    "description": "<p>She waves the caravan through at the old rate.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "t004",
                    "points": 6,
                    "name": "She waives the toll",
                    "reveal": "hidden",
                    "description": "<p>She waives the toll and tells the party who on the council ordered it.</p>"
